 },
 {
  "text": "Our factory starts at seven.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a2_our_factory_starts_at_seven.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "My team is here in Sorocaba.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a2_my_team_is_here_in_sorocaba.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Our factory makes flavor and fragrance.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a2_our_factory_makes_flavor_and_fragrance.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Their office is in France.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a2_their_office_is_in_france.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "We have two divisions: flavor and fragrance.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a2_we_have_two_divisions_flavor_and_fragrance.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "He works in purchasing, and she works in shipping.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a2_he_works_in_purchasing_and_she_works_in_shipping.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "The material comes from France, China and India.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a2_the_material_comes_from_france_china_and_india.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, this is Marcos from purchasing. I have news about the order from France. The material leaves the headquarters on Monday, and it arrives here in three weeks. Our factory starts the production in October. Lucia knows about it, and she talks to the client today. Call me if you need more information. Thank you.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a2_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Good morning, this is Claire. In our group, every country works in the same way. The purchasing team buys the raw material. The factory makes the flavor and the fragrance. The shipping team sends the product to the client. Our headquarters supports every country, but the operation is local. Brazil is a strong operation, and it grows every year.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a2_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Marcos buys the raw material for the factory. The material arrives from France. The factory makes the flavor and the fragrance. Lucia sends the product to the client. The client receives the order in Brazil.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "pc_order_l2.mp3"
 },
